      "label": "man displaying smug expression after implied violent act",
      "description": "The scene depicts a man in a suit with a calm, slightly smug facial expression, overlaid with text that reads 'the look on your face after killing someone!'. The composition juxtaposes the man's composed demeanor with the violent crime described in the text, creating a jarring and unsettling effect. The man is the sole visual participant, and the text is a direct overlay that defines the context and intent of the scene.",
